# Normalise to LF everywhere: `curl | sh` breaks on CRLF shell scripts, and core.autocrlf
# would otherwise check them out with CRLF on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe mis-parses LF-only batch files. Stored as-is (CRLF) so a checkout and
# raw.githubusercontent.com serve the same bytes as the site.
*.cmd -text
